# 📖 Automatic-Writing ✍️🤖 - AI Novel Creation Pipeline for Slow Computers!

> A complete, **fully offline, local-only novel building system** designed specifically for users with **older computers**, **slow hardware**, or limited resources. Our pipeline uses only your CPU and local AI to create complete novels from scratch without needing expensive GPUs or cloud services.

---

## 🎯 What This Pipeline Does (Simple Terms)

Think of it like a professional writer's office that runs entirely in your computer:
- **Generates** novel ideas when you don't know where to start
- **Writes** complete books chapter by chapter using AI
- **Detects** if text looks too "AI-generated" and fixes the problems
- **Creates** beautiful concept art and book covers with FastSD (your fast GPU)
- **Converts** chapters into audiobook audio format using Better-Chatterbox TTS

⚠️ **Important**: This pipeline will completely replace any existing documents you've created before. Always backup your work first!

---
## Setting-up your .env file:
Setting-up your .env file:
You will meed at least one model with a 100,000-200,000 context window which has been extended via the Ollama Modelfile. I would suggest a smaller model which your system will be able to handle the overhead of loading a model with a huge context window. Ollama by default truncates this to 2048 or 4096 tokens. However, if you want a coherent, connected story line you will need some method of at least one of the LLMs with the capacity to ingest the entire pipeline.
https://docs.ollama.com/modelfile


To save your system you should also create a Windows system environment variable to compress all models memory to q4_0. This will compress the memory by 75%.
https://docs.ollama.com/faq#setting-environment-variables-on-windows


