### 4. Create Your Seed Document (Start Point!)
You must create a file called `seed.txt` in the root folder of this project:

**Format must follow this exact structure:**
```
Genre Twist:
[Your genre twist, e.g., A fantasy novel set in ancient Rome with magic]

